# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# EXEMPT: proof transcripts are EVIDENCE, not logs (2026-07-25, AIF-062)
#
# The blanket `*.log` above was written for build/runtime noise (dottalk_*_trace.log
# and friends). It also silently swallowed labtalk/proofs/runs/*.log -- the teed
# transcripts that proofs.yaml rows POINT AT as their evidence.
#
# Measured consequence: 71 proof artifacts on disk, 0 tracked; 7 proofs.yaml rows
# referencing files absent from a clone. The registry's core claim -- that
# `runtime_observed` means a transcript exists -- was unverifiable by anyone who
# was not at this machine. The Table-Buffer WAL lane (2026-07-19) was fully built,
# crash-proven in three phases, and closed out, yet appeared unbuilt to a partner
# surveying the repo.
#
# Evidence must be versioned or the proof registry is fiction.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!labtalk/proofs/**
!labtalk/reports/**

